## VM flags of the release on the servers (backend step 8).
+K true
## The busy-waiting schedulers burn CPU the databases on the same server need (load test, backend step 7).
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
## A lost link to the other server is noticed in 10 s, not 60 (backend step 7, partition test).
-kernel net_ticktime 10
## Keep the witness connected to both servers when only the link between them is cut: with overlapping partitions
## prevented (OTP's default) global would disconnect the witness from one of them, and both servers would then see
## a majority of none (Sms.Switch.Vendor.Quorum).
-kernel prevent_overlapping_partitions false
## One fixed distribution port, so the firewall opens exactly it between the three machines.
-kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9150
-kernel inet_dist_listen_max 9150
